# A value type's constructor whose parameters are a delegate constructor's
# (an object and a native int): the box of its 'boxed' result names
# HandleRef as a value type.
# TEXT-LABEL: .method assembly static native int '__msil_mc.new_handle_ref'(native int, native int) cil managed
# TEXT:       newobj instance void [mscorlib]System.Runtime.InteropServices.HandleRef::.ctor(object, native int)
# TEXT-NEXT:  box valuetype [mscorlib]System.Runtime.InteropServices.HandleRef
# TEXT-NEXT:  call valuetype [mscorlib]System.Runtime.InteropServices.GCHandle [mscorlib]System.Runtime.InteropServices.GCHandle::Alloc(object)
# TEXT-LABEL: .method assembly static void '__msil_mc.handle_free'(native int) cil managed
# TEXT-NOT:   .locals
# TEXT:       unbox [mscorlib]System.Runtime.InteropServices.GCHandle
